---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title={"Visi & Misi — TIDAR"} description={"Visi dan Misi TIDAR"} bodyClass={"inner-page logo-page"} extraCss={["/pages.css"]}>
<Fragment slot="head">
<style is:global>

    :root {
      --vm-red: #d7151b;
      --vm-red-dark: #9f0f14;
      --vm-gold: #e0a11b;
      --vm-bg: #f3f1ee;
      --vm-paper: #ffffff;
      --vm-text: #141414;
      --vm-muted: #5f646d;
      --vm-line: rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.09);
      --vm-shadow: 0 18px 55px rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.08);
      --vm-radius-xl: 32px;
      --vm-radius-lg: 24px;
      --vm-radius-md: 18px;
      --vm-max: 1220px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Manrope", system-ui, sans-serif;
      color: var(--vm-text);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top center, rgba(255,255,255,.86), transparent 40%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #f7f5f2 0%, var(--vm-bg) 100%);
    }
    img { display: block; max-width: 100%; }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

    .vm-page {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0 0 56px;
    }

    .vm-stack { display: grid; gap: 28px; }

    /* Keep the shared Makna Lambang hero truly edge-to-edge, while the
       Visi & Misi content below follows the wider internal-page shell. */
    .vm-page > :not(.ml-hero) {
      width: min(calc(100% - 64px), 1320px);
      margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .vm-card,
    .vm-panel,
    .vm-mission-item,
    .vm-pillars,
    .vm-cta {
      background: var(--vm-paper);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
      box-shadow: var(--vm-shadow);
    }

    .vm-hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 34px;
      background: var(--vm-paper);
      box-shadow: var(--vm-shadow);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(300px, 4.8fr) minmax(340px, 6fr);
      min-height: 445px;
    }

    .vm-hero::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: auto 0 0 0;
      height: 8px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--vm-gold), #f4b737 45%, #ef9a0b 100%);
      z-index: 3;
    }

    .vm-hero-copy {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, #e1161d 0%, var(--vm-red) 58%, #8f090e 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 36px 34px 42px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 34px 150px 150px 34px;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .vm-hero-copy::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 24% 22%, rgba(255,255,255,.12), transparent 20%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 88% 10%, rgba(255,255,255,.08), transparent 18%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 86%, rgba(255,255,255,.08), transparent 22%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .vm-hero-copy::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 20px;
      bottom: 22px;
      width: 64px;
      height: 64px;
      background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(240,175,28,.9) 1.6px, transparent 1.6px);
      background-size: 12px 12px;
      opacity: .9;
    }

    .vm-kicker {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #ffd24d;
    }

    .vm-title,
    .vm-section-title {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Barlow Condensed", Impact, sans-serif;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .01em;
      line-height: .94;
    }

    .vm-title {
      font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 6vw, 6.2rem);
      max-width: 320px;
      text-wrap: balance;
    }

    .vm-underline {
      width: 70px;
      height: 5px;
      margin: 22px 0 20px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffd24d 0%, #f2b11b 100%);
    }

    .vm-hero-copy p:last-child {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(1.12rem, 1.55vw, 1.65rem);
      line-height: 1.6;
      max-width: 365px;
      text-wrap: pretty;
    }

    .vm-hero-media {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 100%;
      background: #ddd center/cover no-repeat;
      background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.04), rgba(0,0,0,.15)), url('/assets/IMG-20250817-WA0063-800x600.jpg');
    }

    .vm-hero-media::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(15,15,15,.22) 0%, rgba(15,15,15,.05) 20%, transparent 42%);
    }

    .vm-vision-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, 4.2fr) minmax(320px, 5.8fr);
      gap: 28px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .vm-panel {
      border-radius: 28px;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 28px;
    }

    .vm-copy .vm-kicker-secondary,
    .vm-section-heading .vm-kicker-secondary,
    .vm-pillars-heading {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .04em;
      color: var(--vm-red);
    }

    .vm-section-title {
      font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 5vw, 4.7rem);
      color: #111;
    }

    .vm-copy p:last-child,
    .vm-section-heading p,
    .vm-pillars-card p,
    .vm-mission-text {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.12rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: #20242a;
    }

    .vm-copy .vm-underline-small,
    .vm-section-heading .vm-underline-small {
      width: 66px;
      height: 4px;
      margin: 18px 0 16px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f3bf3e 0%, #d99c15 100%);
    }

    .vm-visual-card {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 340px;
      border-radius: 28px;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 0;
      background: #e9e5df;
      isolation: isolate;
    }

    .vm-visual-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 20px;
      bottom: 20px;
      z-index: 3;
      width: 78px;
      height: 58px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background-color: rgba(255,255,255,.86);
      background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(224,161,27,.95) 1.7px, transparent 1.7px);
      background-size: 11px 11px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(20,20,20,.10);
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    }

    .vm-visual-card::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 2;
      pointer-events: none;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 58%, rgba(18,18,18,.14) 100%);
    }

    .vm-visual-photo {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 1;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      min-height: 340px;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center;
      filter: saturate(1.02) contrast(1.02);
    }

    .vm-mission {
      display: grid;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 28px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
      box-shadow: var(--vm-shadow);
    }

    .vm-section-top {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(160px, 170px) 1fr;
      gap: 22px;
      align-items: end;
    }

    .vm-section-heading p {
      max-width: 830px;
    }

    .vm-mission-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .vm-mission-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 58px 92px 1fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 18px;
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }

    .vm-badge {
      width: 58px;
      height: 58px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f51c24, #c80712);
      color: #fff;
      font-family: "Barlow Condensed", Impact, sans-serif;
      font-size: 2rem;
      line-height: 1;
      box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.25), 0 10px 18px rgba(215,21,27,.16);
    }

    .vm-icon-wrap {
      width: 74px;
      height: 74px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fffaf0, #faf7ef);
      border: 1px solid rgba(224,161,27,.16);
      color: var(--vm-gold);
      position: relative;
    }

    .vm-icon-wrap::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      right: -10px;
      top: 12px;
      bottom: 12px;
      width: 1px;
      background: var(--vm-line);
    }

    .vm-icon-wrap svg {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      stroke: currentColor;
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 1.9;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-linejoin: round;
    }

    .vm-pillar-icon svg {
      width: 74px;
      height: 74px;
      stroke: currentColor;
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 1.45;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-linejoin: round;
    }

    .vm-mission-text {
      min-width: 0;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-wrap: pretty;
    }

    .vm-pillars {
      padding: 28px 24px 30px;
      border-radius: 28px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .vm-pillars::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      right: 18px;
      bottom: 18px;
      width: 60px;
      height: 48px;
      opacity: .42;
      background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(224,161,27,1) 1.5px, transparent 1.5px);
      background-size: 11px 11px;
    }

    .vm-pillars-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .vm-pillars-card {
      position: relative;
      padding: 18px 18px 0;
      text-align: center;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .vm-pillars-card:not(:first-child)::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: -9px;
      top: 18px;
      bottom: 18px;
      width: 1px;
      background: var(--vm-line);
    }

    .vm-pillar-icon {
      width: 86px;
      height: 86px;
      margin: 0 auto 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: var(--vm-gold);
    }

    .vm-pillars-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 1.02rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .02em;
    }

    .vm-pillars-card p {
      font-size: .97rem;
      color: #2e3238;
    }

    .vm-cta {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 28px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      align-items: stretch;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e6151d 0%, #cc0f17 56%, #96070d 100%);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .vm-cta::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      right: 16px;
      bottom: 18px;
      width: 72px;
      height: 72px;
      background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(240,175,28,.92) 1.5px, transparent 1.5px);
      background-size: 11px 11px;
      opacity: .92;
    }

    .vm-cta-media {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 300px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,.14), rgba(255,255,255,0) 55%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 58% 38%, rgba(255,255,255,.26), transparent 38%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.12), rgba(255,255,255,0));
    }

    .vm-cta-media::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(224,22,29,0) 0 44%, rgba(224,22,29,.18) 100%),
        linear-gradient(160deg, transparent 0 18%, rgba(255,255,255,.16) 18% 34%, transparent 34% 100%);
    }

    .vm-cta-flag {
      position: absolute;
      left: 52px;
      top: 18px;
      width: 220px;
      height: 150px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #d8111b 0 50%, #fff 50% 100%);
      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 93% 12%, 100% 54%, 90% 100%, 0 100%, 12% 50%);
      filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.18));
      opacity: .97;
    }

    .vm-cta-media img {
      position: absolute;
      left: 18px;
      bottom: 0;
      width: min(94%, 310px);
      height: auto;
      object-fit: contain;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 18px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.18));
    }

    .vm-cta--visual-only .vm-cta-media {
      min-height: 300px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1080px) {
      .vm-page { width: 100%; }
      .vm-hero {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        min-height: unset;
      }
      .vm-hero-copy {
        border-radius: 32px 32px 0 0;
        padding-bottom: 30px;
      }
      .vm-hero-copy::after { left: 22px; bottom: 16px; }
      .vm-hero-media { min-height: 360px; }
      .vm-vision-grid,
      .vm-cta,
      .vm-section-top {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .vm-cta-media { min-height: 250px; }
      .vm-pillars-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0,1fr)); }
      .vm-pillars-card:nth-child(4)::before,
      .vm-pillars-card:nth-child(5)::before { display: none; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .vm-page { width: 100%; padding-top: 0; }
      .vm-page > :not(.ml-hero) { width: calc(100% - 32px); }
      .vm-stack { gap: 20px; }
      .vm-hero,
      .vm-panel,
      .vm-mission,
      .vm-pillars,
      .vm-cta { border-radius: 24px; }
      .vm-hero-copy {
        padding: 24px 22px 34px;
        border-radius: 24px 24px 0 0;
      }
      .vm-title { font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 16vw, 5.5rem); max-width: none; }
      .vm-hero-copy p:last-child,
      .vm-copy p:last-child,
      .vm-section-heading p,
      .vm-mission-text,
      .vm-pillars-card p { font-size: 1rem; }
      .vm-hero-media { min-height: 250px; }
      .vm-panel { padding: 22px 18px; }
      .vm-visual-card { min-height: 250px; }
      .vm-visual-photo { min-height: 250px; }
      .vm-mission { padding: 22px 16px; }
      .vm-section-top { gap: 12px; }
      .vm-section-title { font-size: clamp(2.95rem, 14vw, 4.2rem); }
      .vm-mission-item {
        grid-template-columns: 52px 64px 1fr;
        gap: 14px;
        padding: 14px;
      }
      .vm-badge { width: 52px; height: 52px; font-size: 1.9rem; border-radius: 14px; }
      .vm-icon-wrap { width: 60px; height: 60px; }
      .vm-icon-wrap::after { right: -8px; top: 8px; bottom: 8px; }
      .vm-icon-wrap svg { width: 28px; height: 28px; }
      .vm-pillar-icon svg { width: 74px; height: 74px; }
      .vm-pillars { padding: 24px 18px 28px; }
      .vm-pillars-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 6px 10px; }
      .vm-pillars-card { padding: 14px 10px 10px; }
      .vm-pillars-card::before { display: none !important; }
      .vm-pillar-icon { width: 86px; height: 86px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
      .vm-pillars-card h3 { font-size: .95rem; }
      .vm-pillars-card p { font-size: .9rem; }
      .vm-cta { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .vm-cta-media,
      .vm-cta--visual-only .vm-cta-media { min-height: 230px; }
      .vm-cta-flag { left: 30px; width: 170px; height: 118px; }
      .vm-cta-media img { width: min(86%, 235px); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .vm-page { width: 100%; padding-bottom: 28px; }
      .vm-page > :not(.ml-hero) { width: calc(100% - 16px); }
      .vm-hero-copy { padding: 20px 18px 28px; }
      .vm-kicker,
      .vm-copy .vm-kicker-secondary,
      .vm-section-heading .vm-kicker-secondary,
      .vm-pillars-heading { font-size: .92rem; }
      .vm-title { font-size: clamp(2.9rem, 14vw, 4.7rem); }
      .vm-hero-copy p:last-child { max-width: none; font-size: 1rem; }
      .vm-hero-media { min-height: 224px; background-position: center; }
      .vm-panel { padding: 20px 16px; }
      .vm-visual-card { min-height: 210px; }
      .vm-visual-photo { min-height: 210px; }
      .vm-visual-card::before { left: 14px; bottom: 14px; width: 68px; height: 50px; }
      .vm-visual-photo { min-height: 210px; }
      .vm-mission { padding: 18px 12px; }
      .vm-mission-item {
        grid-template-columns: 48px 52px minmax(0,1fr);
        gap: 9px;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 12px 18px 12px 12px;
      }
      .vm-badge { width: 48px; height: 52px; font-size: 1.7rem; border-radius: 12px; }
      .vm-icon-wrap { width: 50px; height: 50px; }
      .vm-icon-wrap::after { right: -5px; top: 7px; bottom: 7px; }
      .vm-mission-text { font-size: .93rem; line-height: 1.55; }
      .vm-pillars-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; }
      .vm-pillars-card {
        text-align: left;
        padding: 12px 0 6px;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 86px 1fr;
        gap: 12px;
        align-items: start;
      }
      .vm-pillar-icon { margin: 0; width: 86px; height: 86px; }
      .vm-pillars-card p { margin-top: 6px; }
      .vm-pillars-card .vm-pillar-text { min-width: 0; }
      .vm-cta-media,
      .vm-cta--visual-only .vm-cta-media { min-height: 190px; }
      .vm-cta-flag { left: 20px; top: 14px; width: 136px; height: 98px; }
      .vm-cta-media img { left: 8px; width: min(82%, 188px); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 380px) {
      .vm-mission-item {
        grid-template-columns: 44px 46px minmax(0,1fr);
        gap: 7px;
        padding-right: 14px;
      }
      .vm-badge { width: 44px; height: 48px; font-size: 1.55rem; }
      .vm-icon-wrap { width: 44px; height: 44px; }
      .vm-icon-wrap svg { width: 25px; height: 25px; }
      .vm-mission-text { font-size: .875rem; }
    }
  
</style>
</Fragment>
<main class="vm-page vm-stack" id="main"><section aria-labelledby="mlHeroTitle" class="ml-hero">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-shape">
<svg focusable="false" preserveaspectratio="none" viewbox="0 0 1600 560">
<defs>
<lineargradient id="mlHeroRedGradient" x1="0" x2="1" y1="0" y2="1">
<stop offset="0" stop-color="#ef101c"></stop>
<stop offset="0.48" stop-color="#e20d19"></stop>
<stop offset="1" stop-color="#c80712"></stop>
</lineargradient>
<pattern height="22" id="mlHeroDotPattern" patternunits="userSpaceOnUse" width="22">
<circle cx="3" cy="3" fill="#ffffff" fill-opacity="0.14" r="1.7"></circle>
</pattern>
</defs>
<path class="ml-hero-shape-red" d="M0 0H1145C1112 105 1075 215 1028 326C975 450 905 535 760 560H0Z" fill="url(#mlHeroRedGradient)"></path>
<path class="ml-hero-shape-dots" d="M0 0H1145C1112 105 1075 215 1028 326C975 450 905 535 760 560H0Z" fill="url(#mlHeroDotPattern)"></path>
<path class="ml-hero-shape-edge" d="M1145 0C1112 105 1075 215 1028 326C975 450 905 535 760 560" fill="none"></path>
</svg>
</div>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-ribbons"></div>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-dots"></div>
<div class="ml-hero-inner">
<div class="ml-hero-copy">
<p class="ml-eyebrow">Tentang Organisasi</p>
<h1 class="ml-hero-title" id="mlHeroTitle"><span>Visi</span><span>&amp; Misi</span></h1>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-rule"></div>
<p class="ml-hero-lead">Arah perjuangan TIDAR dalam membangun generasi muda yang berkarakter, berdaya, dan berdedikasi bagi Indonesia.</p>
</div>
<figure class="ml-garuda-panel">
<img alt="Garuda Pancasila, lambang negara Republik Indonesia" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="1042" src="/assets/garuda-pancasila-authentic.webp" width="960"/>
<figcaption class="ml-garuda-caption"><span>Lambang Negara</span><span>Republik Indonesia</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="visi-title" class="vm-vision-grid">
<article class="vm-panel vm-copy">
<p class="vm-kicker-secondary">Visi TIDAR</p>
<h2 class="vm-section-title" id="visi-title">Visi</h2>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="vm-underline-small"></div>
<p>Menjadi Organisasi Kepemudaan yang mampu menyelamatkan masa depan Indonesia dengan membangkitkan semangat Nasionalisme berdasarkan Pancasila dan UUD 1945.</p>
</article>
<aside aria-label="Visual identitas TIDAR" class="vm-panel vm-visual-card">
<img alt="Kader TIDAR" class="vm-visual-photo" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/tidar-kaderisasi.webp"/>
</aside>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="misi-title" class="vm-mission">
<div class="vm-section-top">
<div class="vm-section-heading">
<p class="vm-kicker-secondary">Misi TIDAR</p>
<h2 class="vm-section-title" id="misi-title">Misi</h2>
</div>
<div class="vm-section-heading">
<p>Lima arah kerja organisasi untuk membentuk pemuda berkarakter, berdaya, dan berdedikasi bagi Indonesia.</p>
</div>
</div>
<ol class="vm-mission-list">
<li class="vm-mission-item">
<span class="vm-badge">01</span>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="vm-icon-wrap">
